  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Feel the rhythm, embrace the legacy, and channel the vibrant culture of Jamaica with the adidas Handball Spezial Jamaica. Originally released in the ‚Äò70s, these Spezial shoes are a timeless classic that blends vintage sport heritage with contemporary style that still feels fresh today. Built with a suede upper for a supple feel, these shoes offer a timeless look that‚Äôs loved by fans of the original design. The soft gum rubber outsole delivers optimal traction, making these shoes as functional as they are iconic. Whether you‚Äôre on the court or the streets, the adidas Handball Spezial Jamaica brings together comfort, style, and nostalgia in one solid package.</p> <p><strong>adidas Handball Spezial Jamaica features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Suede upper offers durability and comfort.</li> <li>Eye-catching design elevates the look.</li> <li>Soft gum rubber outsole ensures traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Vintage indoor-sport style still hits every day. The adidas Handball Spezial Jamaica brings the same low-profile shape that made the original a staple in the ‚Äô70s, pairing a soft suede upper with a classic gum sole for easy comfort and standout heritage appeal.</p><ul><li>Suede upper delivers a soft, premium feel.</li><li>Low-profile silhouette keeps the look clean and versatile.</li><li>Gum rubber outsole provides durable traction.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, we recommend considering a half size down if you‚Äôre between sizes, since many reviewers found the silhouette slightly roomy. The profile stays streamlined and close to the foot, while many shoppers still found it comfortable for all-day wear.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday wear, long walks, and easy styling with everything from shorts and jeans to more polished casual looks.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p><p>This is the kind of sneaker that slips easily into a daily rotation. Reviewers love the classic look, vintage sport edge, and wear-with-anything versatility, whether the day calls for casual comfort or a sharper off-court fit.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the comfort shows up quickly, while the upper continues to soften and conform over time. Quality materials and solid construction are frequent callouts, making it a dependable option for regular wear.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Handball Spezial Jamaica - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Green</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>HQ9435</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">adidas Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;